comments.body:
Hey Úna, it's not too common that you'll get asked something like 'Déan cur síos ort féin', describe yourself. It used to be much more of a Junior Cert Oral question when that was around but you can be asked anything within the topics.

I would answer with something like;

Is duine cinéalta agus cabhrach mé, tá gruiag donn orm le súile glasa....then go into my family..
